#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:1
msgid "用于 Ising 模型的模拟退火"
msgstr "Simulated Annealing for Ising Models"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:3
msgid ""
"模拟退火（simulated annealing，SA）是 KPP "
"中可本地运行的采样基线。它既可用于寻找低能构型，也可在合适的有限温度和采样设置下，为玻尔兹曼机训练提供近似样本。"
msgstr "Simulated annealing (SA) is a locally runnable sampling baseline in KPP. It can be used both to find low-energy configurations and, with appropriate finite-temperature and sampling settings, to provide approximate samples for Boltzmann machine training."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:5
msgid "Ising 模型与玻尔兹曼分布"
msgstr "The Ising Model and the Boltzmann Distribution"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Ising 模型使用自旋 $s_i \\in \\{-1, +1\\}$ 表示变量："
msgstr "The Ising model represents variables with spins $s_i \\in \\{-1, +1\\}$:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"H(\\mathbf{s}) = -\\sum_i h_i s_i - \\sum_{i<j} J_{ij}s_i s_j.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:13
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"在温度 $T$ 下，构型的概率与 $\\exp(-H(\\mathbf{s}) / T)$ 成正比。KPP 将玻尔兹曼机的参数转换为相应的 "
"Ising 矩阵；采样器接收该矩阵并由 Kaiwu SDK 的 `solve()` 方法求解。"
msgstr "At temperature $T$, the probability of a configuration is proportional to $\\exp(-H(\\mathbf{s}) / T)$. KPP converts Boltzmann machine parameters into the corresponding Ising matrix; the sampler receives this matrix and solves it through the Kaiwu SDK `solve()` method."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:15
msgid "从优化到采样"
msgstr "From Optimization to Sampling"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:17
msgid "典型的模拟退火从高温随机构型开始，反复提出翻转一个自旋。对于能量变化 $\\Delta E$，Metropolis 接受概率为："
msgstr "Typical simulated annealing starts from a random configuration at high temperature and repeatedly proposes flipping one spin. For an energy change $\\Delta E$, the Metropolis acceptance probability is:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:19
msgid ""
"\n"
"P_{\\mathrm{accept}} = \\min\\left(1, \\exp\\left(-\\frac{\\Delta "
"E}{T}\\right)\\right).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:23
msgid "温度逐步降低时，算法更倾向保留低能构型。若目标是优化，可继续降温以寻找较低能量；若目标是近似玻尔兹曼采样，则必须明确温度、退火调度、独立运行次数和样本相关性。退火终点的构型不能自动视为无偏玻尔兹曼样本。"
msgstr "As temperature decreases, the algorithm is more likely to retain low-energy configurations. If the goal is optimization, cooling can continue to seek lower energy; if the goal is approximate Boltzmann sampling, the temperature, annealing schedule, number of independent runs, and sample correlation must be specified. A configuration at the end of annealing cannot automatically be treated as an unbiased Boltzmann sample."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:25
msgid "在 KPP 中使用 SA"
msgstr "Using SA in KPP"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:27
msgid ""
"KPP 的 `AbstractBoltzmannMachine.sample()` 会构造 Ising 矩阵并调用优化器。用户只需创建 "
"`SimulatedAnnealingOptimizer` 并传入模型："
msgstr "`AbstractBoltzmannMachine.sample()` in KPP constructs an Ising matrix and calls an optimizer. Users only need to create a `SimulatedAnnealingOptimizer` and pass it to the model:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:39
msgid ""
"此处 `samples` 是模型返回的状态张量；KPP 在内部调用 `sampler.solve(ising_mat)`，而不是 "
"`sampler.sample(hamiltonian)`。"
msgstr "Here, `samples` is the state tensor returned by the model. Internally, KPP calls `sampler.solve(ising_mat)`, not `sampler.sample(hamiltonian)`."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:41
msgid "与真机采样的关系"
msgstr "Relationship to Real-Hardware Sampling"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:43
msgid ""
"SA 是本地开发、调试和基线实验的合适起点。CIM "
"真机采样需要凭据、任务排队和配额；是否带来收益需要针对具体模型、样本质量指标和端到端耗时进行实验比较。"
msgstr "SA is a suitable starting point for local development, debugging, and baseline experiments. CIM real-hardware sampling requires credentials, task queueing, and quota; whether it provides a benefit must be evaluated for the specific model, sample-quality metrics, and end-to-end time."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:45
msgid "小结"
msgstr "Summary"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:47
msgid "SA 通过 Metropolis 更新和温度调度探索 Ising 能量景观。"
msgstr "SA explores the Ising energy landscape through Metropolis updates and a temperature schedule."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:48
msgid "优化与玻尔兹曼采样的目标不同；有限温度设置与样本评估不可省略。"
msgstr "Optimization and Boltzmann sampling have different goals; finite-temperature settings and sample evaluation are essential."

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/simulated_annealing.md:49
msgid "在 KPP 中，SA 与其他优化器一样通过 `rbm.sample(sampler)` 使用。"
msgstr "In KPP, SA is used through `rbm.sample(sampler)` like other optimizers."

